      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "While \"temporary synchronization delay\" is less immediately alarming, it might not be truthful and could be easily disproven under further scrutiny. Using plausible deniability is risky because the media and sophisticated users will likely press for the actual cause. It is best to own a *technical configuration issue* rather than inventing a complex system delay to maintain the most credible ground for your response.",
